  "notes": "Warm-neutral gray sidebar/list (#f6f6f5) against a white reading pane; almost no color except a small blue unread dot and red danger/notification accents. Sources are represented by tiny gray monogram tiles (first letter / first CJK character) instead of favicons. Read vs unread is encoded purely by title weight plus a dot. Article shows a translated Chinese title with the English original as subtitle, and a 中文/原文 toggle swaps the body. Highlight is a soft yellow underline-style mark. End-of-article '完' ornament with reading time and a keyboard-hinted (J) next-article card; list ends with a playful '到底了 互联网读不完，眼睛要休息。' end marker. Reading settings popover offers 浅色/护眼/深色 themes, four fonts (系统默认/思源黑体/思源宋体/霞鹜文楷), size steps, line spacing and column width."
